Description: satori installer (live session only)
 satori-install copies the satori live system to a whole disk, with optional
 LUKS2 encryption, on BIOS or UEFI machines, using a keyboard-driven gum
 interface. It also has an unattended mode for automated tests.
 .
 This package belongs to the live image only; the installer purges it from
 the installed system.
